{"page":184,"verses":[{"verse_key":"8:53","surah":8,"ayah":53,"ar_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ بِأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَمْ يَكُ مُغَيِّرًا نِّعْمَةً أَنْعَمَهَا عَلَىٰ قَوْمٍ حَتَّىٰ يُغَيِّرُوا۟ مَا بِأَنفُسِهِمْ ۙ وَأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ سَمِيعٌ عَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[He did] this because God would never change a favour He had conferred on a people unless they changed what was within themselves. God is all hearing, all knowing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"8:53"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِأَنَّ","en_gloss":"(is) because","transliteration":"bi-anna","verse_key":"8:53"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"8:53"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"8:53"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَكُ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"yaku","verse_key":"8:53"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مُغَيِّرًۭا","en_gloss":"One Who changes","transliteration":"mughayyiran","verse_key":"8:53"},{"pos":7,"ar":"نِّعْمَةً","en_gloss":"a favor","transliteration":"niʿ'matan","verse_key":"8:53"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَنْعَمَهَا","en_gloss":"which He had bestowed","transliteration":"anʿamahā","verse_key":"8:53"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"8:53"},{"pos":10,"ar":"قَوْمٍ","en_gloss":"a people","transliteration":"qawmin","verse_key":"8:53"},{"pos":11,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"8:53"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يُغَيِّرُوا۟","en_gloss":"they change","transliteration":"yughayyirū","verse_key":"8:53"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"8:53"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بِأَنفُسِهِمْ ۙ","en_gloss":"(is) in themselves","transliteration":"bi-anfusihim","verse_key":"8:53"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَأَنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-anna","verse_key":"8:53"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"8:53"},{"pos":17,"ar":"سَمِيعٌ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Hearing","transliteration":"samīʿun","verse_key":"8:53"},{"pos":18,"ar":"عَلِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"All-Knowing","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"8:53"},{"pos":19,"ar":"٥٣","en_gloss":"(53)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"8:53"}]},{"verse_key":"8:54","surah":8,"ayah":54,"ar_uthmani":"كَدَأْبِ ءَالِ فِرْعَوْنَ ۙ وَٱلَّذِينَ مِن قَبْلِهِمْ ۚ كَذَّبُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِ رَبِّهِمْ فَأَهْلَكْنَـٰهُم بِذُنُوبِهِمْ وَأَغْرَقْنَآ ءَالَ فِرْعَوْنَ ۚ وَكُلٌّ كَانُوا۟ ظَـٰلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They are indeed like Pharaoh’s people and those before them, who denied the signs of their Lord: We destroyed them for their sins, and We drowned Pharaoh’s people- they were all evildoers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"كَدَأْبِ","en_gloss":"Like (the) way","transliteration":"kadabi","verse_key":"8:54"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَالِ","en_gloss":"(of) people","transliteration":"āli","verse_key":"8:54"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِرْعَوْنَ ۙ","en_gloss":"(of) Firaun","transliteration":"fir'ʿawna","verse_key":"8:54"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"and those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"8:54"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"(were) from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"8:54"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَبْلِهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"before them","transliteration":"qablihim","verse_key":"8:54"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَذَّبُوا۟","en_gloss":"They denied","transliteration":"kadhabū","verse_key":"8:54"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"(the) Signs","transliteration":"biāyāti","verse_key":"8:54"},{"pos":9,"ar":"رَبِّهِمْ","en_gloss":"(of) their Lord","transliteration":"rabbihim","verse_key":"8:54"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَأَهْلَكْنَـٰهُم","en_gloss":"so We destroyed them","transliteration":"fa-ahlaknāhum","verse_key":"8:54"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِذُنُوبِهِمْ","en_gloss":"for their sins","transliteration":"bidhunūbihim","verse_key":"8:54"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَأَغْرَقْنَآ","en_gloss":"and We drowned","transliteration":"wa-aghraqnā","verse_key":"8:54"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ءَالَ","en_gloss":"(the) peop