5,"en":"who, whenever you [Prophet] make a treaty with them, break it, for they have no fear of God.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"Those who ","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"8:56"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَـٰهَدتَّ","en_gloss":"you made a covenant","transliteration":"ʿāhadtta","verse_key":"8:56"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"with them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"8:56"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"8:56"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَنقُضُونَ","en_gloss":"they break","transliteration":"yanquḍūna","verse_key":"8:56"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَهْدَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their covenant","transliteration":"ʿahdahum","verse_key":"8:56"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"[in]","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"8:56"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"8:56"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَرَّةٍۢ","en_gloss":"time","transliteration":"marratin","verse_key":"8:56"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"8:56"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"8:56"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَتَّقُونَ","en_gloss":"fear (Allah)","transliteration":"yattaqūna","verse_key":"8:56"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٥٦","en_gloss":"(56)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"8:56"}]},{"verse_key":"8:57","surah":8,"ayah":57,"ar_uthmani":"فَإِمَّا تَثْقَفَنَّهُمْ فِى ٱلْحَرْبِ فَشَرِّدْ بِهِم مَّنْ خَلْفَهُمْ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَذَّكَّرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If you meet them in battle, make a fearsome example of them to those who come after them, so that they may take heed.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَإِمَّا","en_gloss":"So if","transliteration":"fa-immā","verse_key":"8:57"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَثْقَفَنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"you gain dominance over them","transliteration":"tathqafannahum","verse_key":"8:57"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"8:57"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْحَرْبِ","en_gloss":"the war","translitera